		"type": "thesis",
		"genre": "Dissertation",
		"publisher": "University of Hamburg",
		"title": "<i>Malkǝʾa Gubāʾe</i> Manuscripts and the Development of <i>Malkǝʾ</i> Anthologies",
		"author": [
			{
				"family": "Dickinson",
