		"title": "Representations of the History of Beta ʾƎsrāʾel (Ethiopian Jews) in the Royal Chronicle of King Śarḍa Dǝngǝl (r.1563‒1597): Censorship, a Philological and Historical Commentary",
		"URL": "https://www.fdr.uni-hamburg.de/record/14097",
