		"type": "article-journal",
		"container-title": "פעמים. Peʿamim",
		"title": "The Last Campaign of the Kingdom of the Gideonites. New Insight Following a First Visit to Sägänät, the Capital of Jewish Rule in the Sǝmen Mountains",
		"author": [
			{
				"family": "Kribus",
				"given": "Bar"
			},
