		"source": "Library of Congress ISBN",
		"title": "Ibn Ḥajar al-ʿAsqalānī’s Texts and Contexts: Producing a Sufi Environment in the Cairo Sultanate",
		"URL": "https://brill.com/edcollbook-oa/title/59478",
