		"abstract": "This article reviews the Amharic booklet Fidälën Mašššašal published in Addis Abeba in 1940 Eth. (= 1948). This booklet deals with the reform of the Ethiopian alphabet and enumerates the ideas of Ras Imru, Ato Abbäbä Rätta, Blatta Marsë'ē Hazän, and of Dr. F. C. Laubach. The present article also makes some suggestions in connection with the proposed reform of the alphabet.",
