	{
		"id": "http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/DCJ64ENP",
		"type": "article-journal",
		"abstract": "Nel ms. etiopico Or. 641 del British Museum si trova una miniatura della Vergine Maria, forse del sec. XVII o anche più antica, che, per i caratteri iconografici e stilistici, si rivela di arte italiana, come prodotto diretto oppure da essa ispirato. Il modello pare risalire ai secc. XIV-XV. Dans le ms. éthiopien Or. 641 du British Museum il existe une miniature de la Vierge Marie, remontant au XVII e siècle ou même plus ancienne, qui, grâce à ses caractéristiques iconographiques et stylistiques, paraît descendre directement de l'art italien, ou semble en être inspirée et dont le modèle pourrait remonter aux siècles XIV-XV. In the Ethiopie manuscript Or. 641, in the British Museum, there is a picture of the Virgin Mary, possibly painted in the XVIIth century or even earlier.The iconography and style of the picture, which is poorly executed, appears to belongto the Italian art, and the painting may be an original Italian product, or one influenced by that art. The iconographie pattern of the picture appears to date back to the XlVth or XVth century.",
		"container-title": "Rassegna di Studi Etiopici",
		"DOI": "10.2307/41299508",
		"ISSN": "03900096",
