		"title": "Transfer of Knowledge in Twentieth-Century Muslim Ethiopia: The Library of al-Šayḫ al-Ḥāǧǧ Ḥabīb from Wällo",
		"title-short": "Transfer of Knowledge in Twentieth-Century Muslim Ethiopia",
